  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Désolée de te sauter dessus comme ça, mais\nj’aimerais que tu m’aides à trouver quelqu’un !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je cherche une Dresseuse Dracologue ayant\nun Kravarech comme partenaire.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Elle est grande, elle a des cheveux verts...\net enfin...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C006C006500200065007300740020006700720061006E00640065002C00200065006C006C006500200061002000640065007300200063006800650076006500750078002000760065007200740073002E002E002E000A0065007400200065006E00660069006E002E002E002E00100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Elle s’habille avec un style punk, comme si elle\nvenait de se bastonner dans la rue !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu rencontres quelqu’un qui correspond à\ncette description, fais-moi signe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je cherche une Dracologue ayant un Kravarech\ncomme partenaire, grande, aux cheveux verts,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\net ayant des goûts vestimentaires plutôt punk.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que tu m’veux ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007500650020007400750020006D201900760065007500780020003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais c’est quoi ce déguisement ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100690073002000632019006500730074002000710075006F00690020006300650020006400E900670075006900730065006D0065006E00740020003F002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je m’habille comme ça me chante, OK ?\nTa mère t’a pas appris les bonnes manières ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bref...\nÇa fait un bail qu’on s’est pas vues, Martine.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200650066002E002E002E000A00C700610020006600610069007400200075006E0020006200610069006C0020007100752019006F006E002000732019006500730074002000700061007300200076007500650073002C0020004D0061007200740069006E0065002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouais... J’attends ce jour depuis si longtemps.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe me suis entraînée sans relâche avec\nmes Pokémon pour te battre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça m’étonne pas d’toi, t’es une combattante !\nMais tu sais, moi aussi, j’suis plus forte qu’avant.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parfait ! T’as intérêt à tenir la promesse que\ntu m’as faite la dernière fois que tu m’as battue !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Delphie ! Je vous surprends à vous amuser\nsans moi ? J’exige de prendre part à ce combat.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002E002E002E0020003F002100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh, toi ! C’est notre duel, t’as pas intérêt à\nt’en mêler !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068002C00200074006F0069002000210020004320190065007300740020006E006F0074007200650020006400750065006C002C00200074201900610073002000700061007300200069006E007400E9007200EA0074002000E0000A007420190065006E0020006D00EA006C006500720020002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sachez, mademoiselle, que ma fidèle Delphie\nne se battra pas sans mon autorisation.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela ne vous laisse donc qu’une seule option !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFaire équipe avec <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ici présent<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe\net nous affronter toutes les deux ! ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je guiderai Illumis vers le bonheur !\nMélodelfe, à toi de jouer ! ♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200067007500690064006500720061006900200049006C006C0075006D00690073002000760065007200730020006C006500200062006F006E006800650075007200200021000A004D00E9006C006F00640065006C00660065002C002000E000200074006F00690020006400650020006A006F007500650072002000210020266500100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai gardé l’meilleur pour la fin !\nKravarech, méga-évolue et déchaîne-toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu plaisantais pas quand tu disais que t’étais\ndevenue plus forte...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200070006C0061006900730061006E007400610069007300200070006100730020007100750061006E00640020007400750020006400690073006100690073002000710075006500200074201900E90074006100690073000A0064006500760065006E0075006500200070006C0075007300200066006F007200740065002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et comment ! Mais ma victoire d’aujourd’hui,\nje la dois surtout à <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi qu’il en soit, une victoire, c’est une victoire !\nTu dois tenir la promesse que tu m’as faite !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Delphie ! Faisons équipe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440065006C00700068006900650020002100200046006100690073006F006E0073002000E9007100750069007000650020002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... C’est-à-dire que...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002E002E002E002000432019006500730074002D00E0002D00640069007200650020007100750065002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’fais déjà équipe avec quelqu’un d’autre...\nDésolée, j’vais pas pouvoir tenir ma promesse...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmpf. Cela ne vous a pas empêché de vous allier\nà cette Albia, à ce que je sache...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je... je vous ai expliqué que c’était pour retrouver\nMademoiselle Anya...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On dirait que j’arrive trop tard...\nJ’ai passé trop de temps à m’entraîner !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je comprends, Delphie, t’en fais pas... Et tu sais,\nen fait, je trouve que cette tenue te va bien.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !\nJe te remercie pour ton aide !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000000200021000A004A0065002000740065002000720065006D0065007200630069006500200070006F0075007200200074006F006E002000610069006400650020002100100002011401B60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pfff... Il faut que j’aille me trouver\nune autre partenaire, maintenant.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon rêve serait d’avoir une partenaire toujours\nsur le qui-vive, prête à se battre à tout moment,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\net en qui je peux avoir entièrement confiance !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5428,
